{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>All of them</b> — also their king is with them." "<b>And תנור</b> (an oven) — masculine; therefore the word בוערה has stress on the penult, like לילה, נחלה, עבר על נפשנו. And this verse is inverted, and its meaning is thus: like an oven burning from kneading dough until it ferments, until the baker ceases from stirring — for it needs to be kindled and fired extensively."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:26.512608010Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}